{"ref":"BDB, מַרְעִית","hw":"מַרְעִית","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְעִית</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. pasturing, shepherding, pasturage</strong> (always fig.);—sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְעִיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.1\">Je 23:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.31\">Ez 34:31</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְעִיתֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:1\" href=\"/Psalms.74.1\">ψ 74:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:13\" href=\"/Psalms.79.13\">79:13</a>, etc.;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>pasturing, shepherding</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאן מַרְעִיתִי</span>, of Isr. as flock of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.1\">Je 23:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.31\">Ez 34:31</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:1\" href=\"/Psalms.74.1\">ψ 74:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:13\" href=\"/Psalms.79.13\">79:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 100:3\" href=\"/Psalms.100.3\">100:3</a> + <a data-ref=\"Psalms 95:7\" href=\"/Psalms.95.7\">95:7</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳ מ׳ וְעֶם יָדוֹ</span>, cf. Hup-Now Che).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>pastureage</em>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:6\" href=\"/Hosea.13.6\">Ho 13:6</a> (Now <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּרְעוֹתָם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.9\">Is 49:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:36\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.36\">Je 25:36</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  by meton. = <em>flock</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.21\">Je 10:21</a>.","next":"BDB, רָעָה²","prev":"BDB, מִרְעֶה²"}